            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The function <span class=\"math\">[MATH: f]</span> is defined by <span class=\"math\">[MATH: f(x) = \\dfrac{5}{9}(x - 4).]</span> What is the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: f(22)?]</span></p>",
